  DTS:Description="Ingest EU partner sales files (semicolon-delimited, UTF-8, DD/MM/YYYY dates, comma as the decimal separator, 9-record footer carrying a monetary control total). VAT is supplied inclusive and is backed out per line; the partner VAT registration number is mandatory and rows without one are rejected rather than loaded, and marketing consent is honoured for the customer reference."
